{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-134-1","title":"Psalms 134:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":134,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":134,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to bless God.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3468. B.C. 536. (Title.) A Song of degrees. 120:1; 121:1; 122:1; 123:1; 124:1; 125:1; 126:1; 127:1; 128:1; *titles 129:1; 130:1; 131:1; 132:1; 133:1; *titles bless ye. 103:21; 135:1,2,19-21; 1Ch 23:30-32; Re 19:5 which by night. 130:6; Le 8:35; 1Ch 9:23,33; Lu 2:37; Re 7:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-134-2","title":"Psalms 134:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":134,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":134,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Lift up. 28:2; 63:4; 141:2; La 2:19; 3:41 in the sanctuary. or, in holiness. 26:6; 1Ti 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-134-3","title":"Psalms 134:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":134,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":134,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Lord. 124:8; 146:5,6 bless thee. 14:7; 20:2; 110:2; 128:5; 135:21; Ro 11:26</p>"}]}